variable {β:ℕ→ℝ} {f:ℕ→ℕ}
structure Pooling (ir k ofP:ℕ→ℕ)(β:ℕ→ℝ) : Prop where
 up: StrictMono ofP
 issue (s:ℕ): β s∈ Set.Icc (hat P.R.L P.x s / 2) (2*hat P.R.L P.x s)
 positive(s:ℕ): 0<β s
 received(s:ℕ): Tendsto (fun j=>(RootBook Y (ir (ofP j)) (k (ofP j)) s).beta) atTop (𝓝 (β s))
include Q H
lemma Pooling.fettle (u:StrictMono f) : ∃ c:ℕ→ℕ,∃ β:ℕ→ℝ, StrictMono c ∧ Pooling Y iA kA (f ∘ c) β:=by
 let J(s:ℕ):= Set.Icc (hat P.R.L P.x s/2) (2*hat P.R.L P.x s); let g(i s:ℕ):=(RootBook Y (iA (f i)) (kA (f i)) s).beta
 have ht(s:ℕ) : 0<X s:= ((Real.exp_pos 1).trans_le H).trans_le (Vale.crown ..)
 have he := fun s=>(Q.finance s); have hx(s:ℕ): ∀ᶠ i:ℕ in atTop,g i s ∈ J s:= by filter_upwards [u.tendsto_atTop.eventually (he s)] with i p; exact (Papal.prices_plot Y s (iA (f i)) (kA (f i)) p.enters).2.2.2.1
 let v(i s:ℕ):ℝ:=if g i s∈ J s then g i s else hat P.R.L P.x s
 have hu(i s:ℕ): v i s∈ J s:= by change (if g i s ∈ J s then g i s else hat P.R.L P.x s) ∈ J s; split_ifs with y; exact y; exact ⟨half_le_self (ht s).le, by linarith [ht s]⟩
 letI (s:ℕ):CompactSpace (J s):= isCompact_iff_compactSpace.mp isCompact_Icc
 let K:= fun s:ℕ=> ↥(J s)
 let T:= (s:ℕ)→K s; let w:ℕ → T:= fun i s=> ⟨v i s, hu i s⟩
 obtain ⟨b,hB,c,hc,G⟩:= (show IsSeqCompact (Set.univ:Set ((s:ℕ)→↥(J s))) from isCompact_univ.isSeqCompact) (fun i=> Set.mem_univ (w i)); let β(s:ℕ):= (b s).val
 refine ⟨c,β,hc,u.comp hc,fun s=>(b s).property,fun s=>(half_pos (ht s)).trans_le ((b s).property.1),fun s=>?_⟩
 have hf: Tendsto (fun i=> v (c i) s) atTop (𝓝 (β s)):= continuous_subtype_val.continuousAt.tendsto.comp ((tendsto_pi_nhds.mp G) s)
 apply hf.congr'; filter_upwards [hc.tendsto_atTop.eventually (hx s)] with i q; change (if g (c i) s ∈ J s then g (c i) s else hat P.R.L P.x s) = g (c i) s; exact if_pos q

omit Q H
lemma Pooling.sub {ζ ρ:ℕ→ℕ}(W: Pooling Y ζ ρ f β){m:ℕ→ℕ} (p: StrictMono m): Pooling Y ζ ρ (f∘m) β:=⟨W.up.comp p,W.issue,W.positive,fun s=>(W.received s).comp p.tendsto_atTop⟩
abbrev κFix (β:ℕ→ℝ)(s:ℕ):ℝ:=Real.sqrt (β s)
lemma paidFix {ζ ρ:ℕ→ℕ}(W:Pooling Y ζ ρ f β)(H:Real.exp 1≤P.x)(s:ℕ) : |κFix β s| ≤ 2* bornQ P s:=by
 let Q:= P.V; have ht:0<hat P.R.L P.x s:= ((Real.exp_pos 1).trans_le H).trans_le (Vale.crown ..); let x:=X s; have hx:0<bornQ P s := Real.sqrt_pos.mpr ht; have he: 0<κFix β s:= Real.sqrt_pos.mpr (W.positive s);
 rw [abs_of_pos he]; apply le_of_pow_le_pow_left₀ (n:=2) (by decide) (by positivity); rw [κFix,Real.sq_sqrt (W.positive s).le,mul_pow,bornQ,Real.sq_sqrt ht.le]; linarith only [(W.issue s).2,ht]
lemma Gathering {ζ ρ:ℕ→ℕ}(W:Pooling Y ζ ρ f β)(s:ℕ) : Tendsto (fun i=> (reachCost Y s (ζ (f i)) (ρ (f i)) (κFix β s))) atTop (𝓝 1):=by
 let u:= W.positive s; let U:=Real.sqrt_pos.mpr u; let p:= (((W.received s).sqrt).inv₀ U.ne').const_mul (κFix β s); rw [show κFix β s * _ =1 from mul_inv_cancel₀ U.ne'] at p; exact p
